<title>FRANCE: CDR denies rumour it selling Rhone-Poulenc stake.</title>
<headline>CDR denies rumour it selling Rhone-Poulenc stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Consortium de Realisation (CDR) denied in a statement a market rumour that it was selling its shares in chemicals and drugs group Rhone-Poulenc SA.</p>
<p>The rumour that CDR was sounding out brokers and fund managers to place its stake of some five percent in Rhone-Poulenc depressed the share on Wednesday and Thursday morning.</p>
<p>The Rhone share price rose immediately after the denial.</p>
</text>
